      "text": "Cover photograph of a colourful painted mural on a clinic wall headed 'NGANGELIZWE CHC'. A heart reads 'We are the generation that will end HIV', with slogans 'She conquers' and 'Love yourself!', the handles '@myPrEP_SA' and '@myPrEPSouthAfrica', and a painted young woman in a 'b-wise' T-shirt making a peace sign.",
